5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We should establish a clear system for the car's upkeep and availability. I'll look into the state of the car at handover and the mechanic's remarks at the last service.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see where all our time is actually going! I'll check the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to look at the details before we decide. I shall examine last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know why these things actually fall apart. I'll check what two other car-sharing households said and the weeks of heavy use over the year.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know exactly how much we're spending! I'll check last year's fuel receipts and the trips that repeat weekly to see who's driving the most.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
